# Top-level ignores for the displays monorepo. Each project also has its own
# .gitignore (PlatformIO .pio/, generated Helvetica glyph tables, the proprietary
# HelveticaNeue.ttc, host-preview build artifacts), which still apply per-subdir.

.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local backups of the pre-monorepo per-project git histories (kept outside the
# tree, but ignore here too just in case).
.subrepo-git-backups/
